261 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (     The site is very practical and does a good job and what it was meant to do. We were able to make it in a timely manner and code it in a manner that made sense and worked properly. Since it was primarily done through SquareSpace and hosted for free, it was definitely in the budget since these programs are free.       As the site gets more popular it should be able to handle the traffic from multiple users. The company is a local company and should not see too many users on the page at the same time, but if there were, then it should be able to handle it. Additionally, the database is meant to handle keeping sold puppies and adding new puppies into the file. The most important thing is to make sure that the website is updated according to the Instagram page. It is always important to keep tabs on the website to make sure that there are no new emails and no pending error messages that are taking away from the customer experience. But overall, this website was very feasible and will greatly improve the experience of everyone involved.  )
/E (     The site is very practical and does a good job and what it was meant to do. We were able to make it in a timely manner and code it in a manner that made sense and worked properly. Since it was primarily done through SquareSpace and hosted for free, it was definitely in the budget since these programs are free.       As the site gets more popular it should be able to handle the traffic from multiple users. The company is a local company and should not see too many users on the page at the same time, but if there were, then it should be able to handle it. Additionally, the database is meant to handle keeping sold puppies and adding new puppies into the file. The most important thing is to make sure that the website is updated according to the Instagram page. It is always important to keep tabs on the website to make sure that there are no new emails and no pending error messages that are taking away from the customer experience. But overall, this website was very feasible and will greatly improve the experience of everyone involved.  )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
