263 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (      As the website has almost completed development, we have some plans for the next steps on what we could do to improve the website and experience. The first thing would be to add a credit/debit card feature at checkout to make it easier for customers to checkout. We would have to make the website SSL compatible and add fields in the checkout section for a customer to add this information. Ensuring that the checkout process on the website is secure is very important, and that is why we are sticking to Paypal and other secure payment methods where the security is on the other end. Another thing being planned is to have automatic emails sent to previous customers with updated puppies or even discount codes. They can either use these for themselves or send them to people they know. We also include the option for customers new and old to have the ability to subscribe to a weekly newsletter which includes more puppies that they can potentially be interested in.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
