275 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (     The main requirements were to have a visually appealing website that effectively presented the puppies to the users and made their experience as simple as possible. On the admin side, the site is tied into a database where all puppies and their relevant information can be entered. Each puppy is assigned a unique identifier so that no one can be confused across two pups. When a puppy is sold, they can be updated in this way, but will still remain in the database if they are ever needed for future reference. Because of the unique identifiers, you can add as many puppies as you want without having to worry about confusion. The website also includes a communication feature where Angel can be contacted about anything. As for payments, we included the options of Paypal, Zelle, and Venmo. These are secure and reliable options for payments, and by using these, no one should have issues sending money.  )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
