<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (When creating a website, the user-friendliness of the platform was a top priority. Squarespace stood out when making that decision due to its remarkable interface, making it very simple to build and update the website without the need of advanced technical knowledge. This was especially important as Angel would be the one updating the website as she gets new puppies to put up for sale. Unlike Shopify, which is tailored more towards e-commerce, Squarespace provides a streamlined user experience for smaller businesses like Angels. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
